{"name": "Fixer Undercover", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/extras/8faab9a449184dd812084df8e7369049.poster.avif?t=1784223035\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/extras/8faab9a449184dd812084df8e7369049.webm?t=1784223035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Forget the agent suit. Grab your toolbox. Go Undercover!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udd27 SOLVE WITH YOUR HANDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/extras/2b8607c0b2492ed96bb0eab390e39795.poster.avif?t=1784223035\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/extras/2b8607c0b2492ed96bb0eab390e39795.webm?t=1784223035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unscrew a panel, reroute the power and grind through a hatch. Smash what's in the way. Cells, canteens, maintenance corridors \u2014 all part of the puzzle. Sometimes you crack it with your brain, sometimes with a hammer. <strong>Think smart or hit hard. Both migh</strong>t work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seven chapters. Five tools. Zero gadgets. Just you, your wits, and whatever you find lying around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83e\udd16 MEET WINSTON</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/extras/429d2fce2a56437997ca01ef4b256e2b.poster.avif?t=1784223035\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/extras/429d2fce2a56437997ca01ef4b256e2b.webm?t=1784223035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your drone partner. Hacker, scout, intel source \u2014 and the sharpest mouth in any prison. He'll come through when it matters. Probably.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udd12 THE SETUP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/extras/11a6ee23c302424bcb7c3c30a8f8ca83.poster.avif?t=1784223035\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/extras/11a6ee23c302424bcb7c3c30a8f8ca83.webm?t=1784223035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Redemption Prison. A model facility where Warden Viktor Kozlov runs his \"Born Again\" rehabilitation program. Officially \u2014 he turns criminals into new people. Unofficially \u2014 he brainwashes them. Your mission? Go in undercover as a regular maintenance worker, fix what needs fixing, and gather evidence against Kozlov along the way. <strong>Nobody suspects the guy with a toolbox.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2b50 PRESS &amp; PLAYERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\"One of the best VR puzzle games I have played. I recommend it without hesitation.\"</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2014 Duuro Plays</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\"A highly entertaining spy caper and a worthy addition to any puzzle lover's library.\"</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2014 UploadVR</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\"Gameplay mechanics shine right from the start. Each room is brimming with hidden secrets.\"</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2014 Gaming Hybrid</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/extras/c316f17624c545067619ac0575cbd3e0.poster.avif?t=1784223035\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/extras/c316f17624c545067619ac0575cbd3e0.webm?t=1784223035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udfae WHAT YOU GET</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>7 chapters</strong> \u2014 6 to 8 hours of handcrafted puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>5 core tools</strong> + improvised gear from the environment </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Enhanced PC visuals</strong> \u2014 upgraded beyond the Quest original</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play your way</strong> \u2014 full VR with haptics or flat-screen with keyboard/mouse</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udd76\ufe0f VR COMFORT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Smooth or Teleport locomotion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Smooth or Snap turning </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adjustable motion vignettes </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seated, standing. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/extras/878b2b8ee40cd34656013fffb9a53be0.poster.avif?t=1784223035\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/extras/878b2b8ee40cd34656013fffb9a53be0.webm?t=1784223035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/extras/c1d3a69f54d2b6ad1f3a52e2be0d42c4.poster.avif?t=1784223035\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/extras/c1d3a69f54d2b6ad1f3a52e2be0d42c4.webm?t=1784223035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Infiltrate. Improvise. Expose.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>From former escape room designers who know that the best puzzles give you that feeling of satisfaction and genius when you solve them.</i></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Spy meets puzzler. Go undercover as a maintenance worker in a corrupt prison. Solve handcrafted puzzles sector by sector \u2014 with five tools, one drone sidekick, and zero backup. Think smart or hit hard.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102370/02365e7fc03010b9c44ea596af2d5b3022e23933/header_alt_assets_3.jpg?t=1784223035", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Puzzle", "Escape Room", "Adventure", "Utilities", "Funny", "3D"], "developers": "Creativity AR", "publishers": "Creativity AR", "release_date": "Jul 16, 2026", "price": "$12.78", "appid": "3102370", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "16 July 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/9uJbXQHzy6U", "first_seen": 1787672407.555697}